## This code block defines a DAX query that retrieves and processes financial data from a Power BI semantic model using OLE DB connections.
## The query filters the data to include only financial entities related to Oil or Gas, aggregates key figures by year, metric, and case, and limits the result set to 500,000 rows with deterministic ordering.
## The output includes columns for Year, Metric, Metric Sort, Case, and the aggregated Value.
## Note the connection string has been specifically excluded from this file for security reasons, and the query is intended to be executed within the context of a secure Power BI environment where the user has appropriate access permissions.
## Downstream this query is referenced in the scenario configuration input sheets to support decisions on case inclusion and operation selection.
## It also serves as the base dataset for the scenario model engine, where each case is processed agains the scenario instructions dataframe to produce scenario results.

 // Filter Financial Entities to BP Group Entities = Oil or Gas
    // Updated to use the current table name 'Dim_Financial_Entity_ADL'
    VAR __DS0EntityFilter =
        FILTER(
            KEEPFILTERS(
                VALUES('Dim_Financial_Entity_ADL'[BP_Group_Entities_Text])
            ),
            'Dim_Financial_Entity_ADL'[BP_Group_Entities_Text] IN {
                "Oil",
                "Gas"
            }
        )

    // Core dataset: Year, Metric, Metric Sort, Case and aggregated value
    VAR __DS0Core =
        SELECTCOLUMNS(
            SUMMARIZECOLUMNS(
                'TRANS_FIN_ADL'[Calendar_Year],
                'ACCOUNTS_SORTING'[Description],
                'ACCOUNTS_SORTING'[Sort Key],
                'TRANS_FIN_ADL'[Modelling_Case],

                __DS0EntityFilter,

                "SumCommon_Key_Figure",
                    CALCULATE(
                        SUM('TRANS_FIN_ADL'[Common_Key_Figure])
                    )
            ),

            "Year",
                'TRANS_FIN_ADL'[Calendar_Year],

            "Metric",
                'ACCOUNTS_SORTING'[Description],

            "Metric Sort",
                'ACCOUNTS_SORTING'[Sort Key],

            "Case",
                'TRANS_FIN_ADL'[Modelling_Case],

            "Value",
                [SumCommon_Key_Figure]
        )

    // Limit result set to 500,000 rows with deterministic ordering
    VAR __DS0BodyLimited =
        TOPN(
            500000,
            __DS0Core,
            [Year], 1,
            [Metric Sort], 1,
            [Metric], 1,
            [Case], 1
        )

EVALUATE
    __DS0BodyLimited

ORDER BY
    [Year],
    [Metric Sort],
    [Metric],
    [Case]